836 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7662bcd/uploads/origins/e0eada95-0689-4210-8b4b-e1393d235882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=70eb769a191905303630273940d4446f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I am Jakub and I am studying film in the UK.\n\nI saw your art and I was curious if I could hire you to make an artwork to help me develop my screenplay ideas. I would like a cinematic shot with a character overlooking a futuristic town. Maybe you can look at Blade Runner 2049 for inspiration, but I would like your own original take on what you think a city in the future could look like. The character is a bit mysterious as well. But most importantly feel free to improvise, use your own ideas and make it look like a concept art for a movie you would love to see yourself.\n\nI will use the art as a starting point to print on a wall and write a screenplay based on the inspiration. \n\nThank you kindly in advance! I would have texted you in Japanese, but I am not so confident in my Japanese skills yet.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@31014__/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 21184, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5179933aa9c9e4900d898f787ae45658", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5179933aa9c9e4900d898f787ae45658, https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1aa5368442773b956954d68580f9d4cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50bd7253188ef9b503d71a0950b8d4ca 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d0d7e1d40214690f781d67bf35c93dbe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d0d7e1d40214690f781d67bf35c93dbe, https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf9d3855c603c3747a1b65bf3ede3c9d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3dda5c2/uploads/origins/660cab88-8370-47a9-b4ed-8941fb3f4add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=77eb0dfcd11e9db73d8f432ef4b534b4 3x"}, "body": "いつもお世話になっております。\n前回ミマモの絵をリクエストしたものです。\n素敵なイラストを本当にありがとうございました！！！\n\nそすう先生の描く空の表情が本当に好きなので、前回と対のようなイメージのものを\nリクエストさせていただければと思っております。\nジャンルはミマモロールで、キャラはザックとセクタ（過去の姿）で\n夜の空をふたりで眺めているような構図でお願いできますでしょうか。\n空は、満点の星空だと嬉しいです。\n前回が希望を感じさせる雰囲気のものだったので、今回は切なさや哀愁を感じさせられるものだと\n嬉しいなあと思いますが詳細についてはお任せします。\n\nわがままばかりで恐縮ですが、\n何卒ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@31014__/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 21184, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7aacc532/uploads/origins/0522457f-6736-4ecc-a0a0-13d81476bf05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1333670d4710fcedb4888295916aac68", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7aacc532/uploads/origins/0522457f-6736-4ecc-a0a0-13d81476bf05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cr